what is githubActions?
platform to automate developers workflow, basically it is a CI/CD platform.


GitHub Actions aur Jenkins automation tools hain jo code changes ke baad build, testing aur deployment jaise tasks automatically perform kar 
sakte hain. GitHub Actions GitHub ke saath closely integrated hai,jabki Jenkins ek flexible automation server hai jise tum apni VM par self-host 
kar sakte ho.Hamare project mein pipeline automatically code checkout karegi, 
tests run karegi aur Docker image build karegi. Baad mein isi pipeline ko image registry aur Kubernetes deployment ke saath integrate karenge.

Real-world example: Har code update ke baad developer ko manually testing aur image building nahi karni padti.
